[lesson] Saved: [fixed] torch.OutOfMemoryError: CUDA out of memory. Tried to allocate 170.00 MiB. GPU 0 
[lesson]   Solution: FIX_PLAN: Set MODEL_FREE=true in the env so quantize_wrapper.sh passes --model_free. ModelFreeCompressor reads safetensors shards one-by-one, never loading the full model, while still producing the same auto_round W4A16 packing format (only difference: iters is forced to 0 / RTN). The architecture (Qwen3.5-VL) is handled correctly — ModelFreeCompressor auto-skips non-text modules (vision/audio) by default.;SMOKE_TEST: python3 -c "from auto_round.compressors.model_free import ModelFreeCompressor; from auto_round import AutoRound; ar=AutoRound(model='DavidAU/Qwen3.6-27B-Fable-Fusion-711-Uncensored-Heretic-NM-DAU-MTP',scheme='W4A16',model_free=True,device_map=0); print(type(ar).__name__, ar.iters, ar.model_free)";```;;
